color:#1E1E1E'>For various ribbon options you can combine the Key Tips lett=
ers
with the Alt key to make shortcuts called Access Keys. For example, press <=
span
class=3DSpellE>Alt+H</span> to open the&nbsp;<b>Home</b>&nbsp;tab, and <span
